diff --git a/changelog/69900.added.md b/changelog/69900.added.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e181447
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69900.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Added support to the ``diskusage`` beacon for alerting when a mount's usage drops
+below an expected floor, in addition to the existing high-usage alerting. Configure
+it by replacing the plain percentage with a dict containing ``high`` and/or ``low``
+keys, e.g. ``/mnt/nfs: {high: 90%, low: 5%}``. Existing plain-percentage configuration
+continues to work unchanged.
